# System knowledge

The product map lives in **`SYSTEM.md`** at the repo root (features, pages, flows, RBAC, fees, design). Read the relevant section before changing product behavior.

After you add or change a page, flow, API, or convention, update `SYSTEM.md` in the same change.

## Other rules (do not contradict)

- List pages: `fikr-page-chrome.mdc`
- Form fields: `fikr-form-fields.mdc`
- Row menus: `grid-row-actions.mdc`
- Back button: `back-navigation-button.mdc`
- `/students/register`: `student-register-form.mdc` (wizard, not a list)
- Notifications: `notification-templates.mdc`
- Run/DB/logins: `AGENT_DEPLOY_HANDOFF.md`

Do not treat root `README.md` as current. Do not edit `_fikr-redesign-backup/` or `school-management-backend/dist/` as source.
